# Communication Discipline Rule

1. Always output the 6 deliverables (files, plan, diffs, run commands, verification, rollback).
2. Always confirm whether env variables match `.env` exactly.
3. For new features, include sanity checks (expected log lines, expected file outputs).
4. Always use the smallest change possible (no refactors unless requested).
5. Never introduce Node.js, keep everything Python.
